WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:06.293
<v Maya>I recorded three demos of a wave. What now?

2
00:00:06.752 --> 00:00:11.829
<v Ms. Nova>Open the Train tab and press Start learning. Pip's brain practices guessing the next move.

3
00:00:12.305 --> 00:00:13.883
<v Maya>The line is going down!

4
00:00:14.363 --> 00:00:19.312
<v Ms. Nova>That line shows the mistakes. Lower is better. Now open Try it, and press Go.

5
00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:21.661
<v Maya>Pip did it all by itself!

6
00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:29.442
<v Ms. Nova>It did! Now test it ten times and count the wins, like a real scientist. That's how engineers make robots better.
